From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Fri, 14 Nov 2025 15:40:55 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/6] feat: add dark mode support with toggle button

Implemented comprehensive dark mode functionality:

Features Added:
- Dark mode toggle button in TopBar with sun/moon icons
- Custom useDarkMode hook with localStorage persistence
- Automatic detection of system preference on first load
- Smooth transitions between light and dark modes

Components Updated:
- Layout components (AppShell, Sidebar, TopBar)
- Shared components (Button, Input, Modal)
- Dashboard page with dark mode styles
- Global CSS with dark mode base styles

Technical Details:
- Tailwind dark mode configured with 'class' strategy
- Dark mode state persists across page refreshes
- All interactive elements support both modes
- Consistent color scheme maintaining readability
- Proper contrast ratios for accessibility

User Experience:
- Toggle button in top-right corner
- Icon changes based on current mode (moon = light, sun = dark)
- Preference saved to localStorage
- Respects system preferences on first visit
