Subject: [PATCH 6/6] fix: improve dark mode text contrast across all
 components

Fixes washed out text in dark mode by adding proper dark mode color classes:

Calendar:
- DayCell: Added dark mode for date numbers, backgrounds, borders, and event badges
- MonthGrid: Added dark mode for container, week headers, and borders
- CalendarView: Added dark mode for month heading and navigation buttons
- EventDialog: Added dark mode for labels and checkbox

Kanban:
- KanbanColumn: Added dark mode for column backgrounds, headers, and borders
- KanbanCard: Added dark mode for card backgrounds, text, and action buttons

Todos:
- TodoItem: Added dark mode for cards, text, checkbox, and action buttons
- TodoFilters: Added dark mode for filter buttons and count badges
- AddTodoForm: Added dark mode for form backgrounds, inputs, and buttons

Shared Components:
- EmptyState: Added dark mode for icon background and text
- Select: Added dark mode for dropdown background, border, and text
- Textarea: Added dark mode for textarea background, border, and text

All text now has proper contrast ratios in dark mode for better readability.
